ft leg injuries.","published":"2026-09-07T04:18:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49855215/brauntae-johnson-jason-onye-exit-notre-dame-opener-early","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"USC band won't perform at UCLA football game after members vandalized campus","description":"The USC Trojan Marching Band will not perform during Saturday's rivalry game vs. UCLA after members of the band vandalized a portion of UCLA's campus.","published":"2026-11-26T04:02:46.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50600615/usc-band-perform-members-vandalized-ucla-campus","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kent State TD overturned by replay was incorrect decision, MAC says","description":"A Kent State touchdown catch should not have been overturned by replay to incomplete at the end of Tuesday's 17-12 loss to Eastern Michigan, the Mid-American Conference said Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T23:05:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50597875/kent-state-td-overturned-replay-was-incorrect-mac-says","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 College Football Playoff National Championship odds","description":"Odds and futures to win the 2027 College Football Playoff National Championship.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:57.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/47664633/2027-college-football-playoff-national-championship-odds-futures","type":"Story","byline":"Doug Greenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chris Creighton out as coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons","description":"Chris Creighton is out as head coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons with the school.","published":"2026-11-25T19:05:05.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595706/creighton-coach-eastern-michigan-13-seasons","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Judge denies SEC's request for TRO against LSU in Dec. 3 vote","description":"A federal judge denied the SEC's request for a temporary restraining order to keep LSU from interfering with a Dec. 3 vote of presidents and chancellors on whether to remove the school from the conference.","published":"2026-11-25T20:02:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50595702/judge-denies-sec-request-tro-lsu-dec-3-vote","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 13 Game Day Kickoff: Nothing compares to the outright hatred of a rival","description":"What to expect in Rivalry Week, from top games and players to teams on upset alert.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedaykickoff112526/week-13-top-games-upsets-preview","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Oklahoma State extends Morris with new 6-year deal","description":"Oklahoma State and head coach Eric Morris have agreed to a new six-year deal that will extend his contract through the 2032 season, sources told ESPN's Pete Thamel on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T17:00:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50594432/sources-oklahoma-state-extends-morris-new-six-year-deal","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-25T15:16:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5218506/brauntae-johnson","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brauntae_Johnson"},"pick":{"pick":64,"round":2,"team":"TEN","via":"BUF","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Brauntae Johnson","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brauntae_Johnson","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-25T17:07:12Z","intro":"Brauntae Ladarries Johnson, formerly known as Tae Johnson, is an American college football safety for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Johnson attended North Side High School in Fort Wayne, Indiana. He played wide receiver in high school and finished his career with 139 receptions for 2,286 yards and 41 touchdowns. He committed to the University of Notre Dame to play college football. Johnson also played basketball in high school."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"In his first year at Notre Dame in 2024, Johnson missed time after undergoing foot surgery prior to the season. He returned from the injury to play in three games and redshirted. He entered his redshirt freshman season in 2025 as a backup before taking over as starting free safety against Arkansas."}]}}